Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.97,0:03:22.43,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}怖いか　また目をひらくことが
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.05,0:03:27.97,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎いか　他人事みたいな自分が
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.43,0:03:41.03,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}才能がないことを知ったって
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.30,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}逃げ延びる理由になるのか
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.30,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2\fscx66\fscy66\pos(960,1014)}わけ
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.00,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}内側に響くこの悲鳴に
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.11,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}応えてやれるのは誰だ
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.11,0:03:52.01,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}せめて生涯の幾度かは
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.95,0:03:56.75,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}正直な当事者でありたい
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.60,0:04:00.16,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}それが今日だとしたら？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.18,0:04:05.72,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}怖いか　また目をひらくことが
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.05,0:04:10.44,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎いか　他人事みたいな自分が
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.44,0:04:12.44,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}でも　気付いたんだろう
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.44,0:04:14.07,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}躰は止まれない
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.07,0:04:19.32,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「ただ　失い難い貴方を想えば」
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.32,0:04:22.94,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「くだらない恐怖だ」
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.15,0:04:24.70,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.35,0:04:27.23,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}命さえ晒し唄えば
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.16,0:04:29.55,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.56,0:04:32.30,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}今に分かることだ
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.99,0:04:34.59,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.46,0:04:36.81,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}ここで終わるのか
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.81,0:04:40.05,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}それは嫌だろう
