Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.97,0:03:22.43,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐懼嗎 再次睜開雙眼
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.05,0:03:27.97,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨嗎 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.43,0:03:41.03,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}知道自己沒有才能
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.30,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}但這能成為苟且偷生的藉口嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.00,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}在內心深處響起的悲鳴
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.11,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}究竟由誰來回應
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.11,0:03:52.01,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}至少在一生中有那麼幾次
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.95,0:03:56.75,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}想做個正直的當事者
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.60,0:04:00.16,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}倘若那就是今天？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.18,0:04:05.72,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐懼嗎 再次睜開雙眼
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.05,0:04:10.44,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨嗎 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.44,0:04:12.44,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}然而 你已經察覺到了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.44,0:04:14.07,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}身體已無法停滯不前
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.07,0:04:19.32,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「只因想起那不可失去的你」
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.32,0:04:22.94,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「這點恐懼便不值一提」
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.15,0:04:24.70,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.35,0:04:27.23,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}不惜性命放聲高歌
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.16,0:04:29.55,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.56,0:04:32.30,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}此刻你便知曉
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.99,0:04:34.59,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.46,0:04:36.81,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}要在這裡結束嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.81,0:04:40.05,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}這絕非你所願吧
