Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.61,0:22:20.13,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}テレスコープのぞいて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:22.48,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}見つめてる君
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:25.55,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そこにある日常は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:27.56,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まるでさかさま
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:30.93,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}地に足がつかないわ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.93,0:22:33.34,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}こころうわの空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:36.35,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}行き場のない想いは
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:38.45,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}苦しくなるだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:45.61,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}ああ、辛いや
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:52.62,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}“もしも”なんて呪文
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.62,0:22:55.35,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なんの効力もないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:23:00.43,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部ぜーんぶ　わたしとならいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.43,0:23:02.74,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って思ってしまうんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:05.52,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}好きだよ。好き？大好きだ。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.52,0:23:08.16,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って言えていたのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.16,0:23:10.37,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}食べかけのフローズン
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.37,0:23:13.75,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}シャリシャリなメモリーズ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:15.21,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.58,0:23:16.56,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}足りない　足りない　足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.56,0:23:19.09,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}君成分が足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:20.59,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:21.28,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}触れたい　触れたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.28,0:23:24.52,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}冷たい愛凍えちゃう前に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.73,0:23:28.05,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}温めてよね　お願い
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.61,0:22:20.13,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}透過望遠鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:22.48,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}注視著的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:25.55,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}眼前的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:27.56,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}彷彿顛倒一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:30.93,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雙腳無法踏實著地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.93,0:22:33.34,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}心思早已浮上雲端
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:36.35,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}無處安放的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:38.45,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}只會感到痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:45.61,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}啊 好難受
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:52.62,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}「假如」這類的咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.62,0:22:55.35,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雖然沒有任何效果
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:23:00.43,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部全部 都能和我一起就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.43,0:23:02.74,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}還是忍不住會這樣想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:05.52,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}喜歡你。喜歡？超喜歡。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.52,0:23:08.16,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}明明能說得出口
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.16,0:23:10.37,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}吃到一半的冰沙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.37,0:23:13.75,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}留下沙沙作響的回憶
Comment: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:15.21,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.58,0:23:16.56,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不夠 不夠 還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.56,0:23:19.09,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}你的成分還不夠
Comment: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:20.59,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:21.28,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}想觸碰 想觸碰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.28,0:23:24.52,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在冰冷的愛凍結之前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.73,0:23:28.05,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}請你將它溫暖起來
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
